      const key = side + "|" + (o.isInstancedMesh ? 1 : 0) + "|" + (withMap ? 1 : 0) + "|" + (withAlpha ? 1 : 0) + "|" + (m.wireframe ? 1 : 0); //
      if (seen.has(key)) return; //
